    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/1f90875c262fab8e3e85772794328fbf.poster.avif?t=1752851951\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/1f90875c262fab8e3e85772794328fbf.webm?t=1752851951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/1f90875c262fab8e3e85772794328fbf.mp4?t=1752851951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greenwood Defense is a straightforward 2D strategy game where your main goal is simple: keep your captain safe from endless waves of frog enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll deploy your units and then make them stronger by leveling them up. Each of the <strong>15+ unique units</strong> has four levels and gets new tricks as they grow. Mix and match their special abilities with the <strong>16 permanent upgrades</strong> you can unlock, plus <strong>4 powerful special abilities</strong> you can use during battles. There are tons of ways to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/f2d465f26ea1530a481428e4e80d55a8.avif?t=1752851951\" width=672 height=71 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/7afb50f7a2bb518596dd3838c985fe1a.poster.avif?t=1752851951\" width=608 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/7afb50f7a2bb518596dd3838c985fe1a.webm?t=1752851951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/7afb50f7a2bb518596dd3838c985fe1a.mp4?t=1752851951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/bc6b8b49f8c6a2265113f7b2364d71d6.avif?t=1752851951\" width=701 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/4e4c6ffed4e68ff9682ec0ef4cc785d2.poster.avif?t=1752851951\" width=800 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/4e4c6ffed4e68ff9682ec0ef4cc785d2.webm?t=1752851951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/4e4c6ffed4e68ff9682ec0ef4cc785d2.mp4?t=1752851951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/e4b9798d90e6d442f41913fe77822ece.poster.avif?t=1752851951\" width=608 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/e4b9798d90e6d442f41913fe77822ece.webm?t=1752851951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/e4b9798d90e6d442f41913fe77822ece.mp4?t=1752851951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/9ead1760744583daca47e2e4cad598d6.avif?t=1752851951\" width=742 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/a1ad4648197ccb72fb6490ff50153b34.poster.avif?t=1752851951\" width=608 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/a1ad4648197ccb72fb6490ff50153b34.webm?t=1752851951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/a1ad4648197ccb72fb6490ff50153b34.mp4?t=1752851951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you push through all <strong>100 challenging stages</strong>? You'll face new kinds of frogs every five stages, and even two massive super bosses that'll really test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc14\u00a0<strong>15+ Unique Units:</strong> Each unit levels up four times and gets its own special ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b06\ufe0f <strong>16 Permanent Upgrades:</strong> Boost your defense in different ways that stick around.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>4 Special Battle Abilities:</strong> Use these to turn the tide when things get tough. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>100 Stages:</strong> New enemies pop up every five stages, keeping things fresh. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc51 <strong>2 Super Bosses:</strong> Big, tough enemies to really challenge your strategy. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/1f90875c262fab8e3e85772794328fbf.poster.avif?t=1752851951\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/1f90875c262fab8e3e85772794328fbf.webm?t=1752851951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/1f90875c262fab8e3e85772794328fbf.mp4?t=1752851951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greenwood Defense is a straightforward 2D strategy game where your main goal is simple: keep your captain safe from endless waves of frog enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll deploy your units and then make them stronger by leveling them up. Each of the <strong>15+ unique units</strong> has four levels and gets new tricks as they grow. Mix and match their special abilities with the <strong>16 permanent upgrades</strong> you can unlock, plus <strong>4 powerful special abilities</strong> you can use during battles. There are tons of ways to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/f2d465f26ea1530a481428e4e80d55a8.avif?t=1752851951\" width=672 height=71 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/7afb50f7a2bb518596dd3838c985fe1a.poster.avif?t=1752851951\" width=608 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/7afb50f7a2bb518596dd3838c985fe1a.webm?t=1752851951\" type=\"video/webm; codec